Cell["\<\
Implemented methods are \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Involutions\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Matrix\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. Method \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Matrix\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is based on matrix computing matrix representations \
and then Mathematica\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Det[ ] function.  For large algebras \
Det is fastest \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"23ea4f92-0411-4612-8e5c-9943391dc4bc"],

